/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
45 780 Td
(   # Apply Hanning window to suppress spectral leakage) Tj
T*
(   windowed = sig * np.hanning\(N\)) Tj
T*
(   X = np.fft.rfft\(windowed\)) Tj
T*
(   freqs = np.fft.rfftfreq\(N, d=1/fs\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Single-sided magnitude spectrum in dBV) Tj
T*
(   magnitude = 20 * np.log10\(np.abs\(X\) / \(N / 2\)\)) Tj
T*
(   ```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   The use of `rfft\(\)` exploits Hermitian symmetry $X[k] = X^*[N-k]$ for real-valued signals,) Tj
T*
(   computing only $N/2 + 1$ bins, halving memory and computational FLOPs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
