T*
(   Numerical Condition Number $\\kappa\(A\)$:) Tj
T*
(   $$\\kappa\(A\) = \\|A\\| \\cdot \\|A^{-1}\\| = \\frac{\\sigma_{\\max}}{\\sigma_{\\min}}$$) Tj
T*
(   Calculated via `np.linalg.cond\(A\)`.) Tj
T*
(   - If $\\kappa\(A\) \\approx 1$, the matrix is well-conditioned; errors in $b$ do not amplify.) Tj
T*
(   - If $\\kappa\(A\) \\gg 10^8$, the matrix is ill-conditioned \(near singular\), and numerical) Tj
T*
(   round-off errors can completely destroy the solution accuracy.) Tj
T*
() Tj
