T*
(   1. Dimension Broadcasting: ufuncs automatically broadcast input arrays to a common shape) Tj
T*
(   following broadcasting rules.) Tj
T*
(   2. Type Resolution and Casting: NumPy checks the dtypes of inputs and searches an internal 1D) Tj
