(   [Problem Statement]: Implement a vectorized Digital Phase-Locked Loop \(DPLL\) phase error detector and loop filter in NumPy.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   A DPLL synchronizes the phase of an incoming modulated carrier with a local Numerically) Tj
T*
(   Controlled Oscillator \(NCO\):) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   ```python) Tj
T*
(   import numpy as np) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   def simulate_dpll\(rx_signal, fs, f_nominal, Kp=0.05, Ki=0.001\):) Tj
T*
(   N = len\(rx_signal\)) Tj
T*
(   phase_out = np.zeros\(N\)) Tj
T*
(   phase_nco = 0.0) Tj
T*
(   integrator = 0.0) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   for n in range\(N\):) Tj
T*
(   # Local NCO reference) Tj
T*
(   ref_i = np.cos\(phase_nco\)) Tj
T*
(   ref_q = -np.sin\(phase_nco\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Multiplier phase detector) Tj
T*
(   phase_err = rx_signal[n] * ref_q) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Proportional-Integral \(PI\) loop filter) Tj
T*
(   integrator += Ki * phase_err) Tj
T*
(   freq_adjust = Kp * phase_err + integrator) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   phase_nco += 2 * np.pi * f_nominal / fs + freq_adjust) Tj
T*
(   phase_out[n] = phase_nco) Tj
T*
ET

